@startuml FactoryReset_CableYank
title Factory reset — mid-write connection loss (fail fast, operator-guided recovery)

actor Operator
participant "BootloaderTool\n(host)" as Host
participant "ST ROM bootloader" as BL

Host -> BL : 0x7F -> ACK -> Get -> Get ID -> Erase
loop writing chunks
  Host -> BL : Write Memory (0x31)
  BL --> Host : ACK
end

== cable yanked mid-write ==

Host -x BL : Write Memory (0x31)  [data frame cut]
activate BL
BL -> BL : stuck waiting for the rest\nof the 256-byte frame\n(AN3155 has no mid-command re-sync)
deactivate BL
Host -> Host : serial Read = -1\n-> ConnectionLostException
note over Host : COM handle is now dead;\nbootloader cannot be re-synced

Host -> Host : fail fast — no reconnect poll
Host --> Operator : "Connection lost during transfer.\nRe-enter the bootloader (RESET, then the\nblue button) and click Retry."

== operator recovery ==

Operator -> BL : RESET + blue button (fresh entry)
Operator -> Host : click Retry / re-run
Host -> BL : 0x7F (sync) -> restart from erase\n(see happy-path diagram)

@enduml
